<title>USA: Glenayre gets $31 mln Taiwan contract.</title>
<headline>Glenayre gets $31 mln Taiwan contract.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glenayre Technologies Inc said Monday it has been awarded a $31 million contract from ChungHwa Telecom, Taiwan's national telephone company.</p>
<p>The contract is for a high speed nationwide paging network and was awarded by ChungHwa's long distance and mobile business group, GlenAyre said.</p>
<p>The contract will be implemented over the next 10 to 12 months, the company said.</p>
